WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.111
Start with a silhouette that reads from across the room.

00:00:04.111 --> 00:00:08.736
Divide it into a main shape, a supporting layer and one accent.

00:00:08.736 --> 00:00:12.920
Repeat a color in two small places to connect the design.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:20.262
Before adding detail, consider where the wearer bends and where the costume separates for transport.

00:00:20.262 --> 00:00:27.530
These original boards are design concepts, not a step-by-step construction or tool-safety tutorial.

